The '''Battle of the Gods''' is a special event location that takes place at the [[Castle on the Sea]]. It can be only triggered when [[rip_indra True Form|rip_indra (True Form)]] spawns.

== Event Appearance ==
{{Main|rip_indra True Form}}
The event is triggered when [[rip_indra True Form]] is spawned. When this occurs, the message <span style="color:red;">'''"A barrier has been broken."'''</span> appears in the chat box and at the top of the screen. During the event, all [[islands]] and the surrounding [[sea]] are covered in a foggy ambience.

<gallery>
