== Usage in Item Obtainments ==
{{Main|Tushita/Puzzle}}
During the event, players can begin [[Tushita]]'s puzzle, which may lead to obtaining the sword, and eventually the [[Cursed Dual Katana]].

== Trivia ==
* The Battle of the Gods shares its soundtrack, ''Lizard Bandit Clan'', with the [[Liberation of Tiki Outpost]], [[Swan's Room]], and [[Dimensional Shift]].

